      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "skill_id": 19400,
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "unyielding iron wall",
          "desc": "When Su Lie is about to die, he recovers 70% of his maximum life, but falls into a weak state where he is prohibited from operating. He reduces physical defense by 50 and spell defense by 25 for 4.5 seconds. At the same time, 3 beacons appear around him. Touching by teammates can restore 12% of maximum life for both parties. When all 3 beacons are lit, the weak state ends. At the end, it will cause 150 (+100% physical attack) magic damage and 50% slowdown to nearby enemies, lasting for 2 seconds, and increase the attack speed by 50% and movement speed by 30%, lasting for 5 seconds. Provides a 60% movement speed increase for allied heroes, and the effect will decay within 3 seconds. [Unyielding Iron Wall] has a 120-second cooldown. When not cooled down, Su Lie increases physical and magic defense by 90 points.",
          "cd": "120",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Revive",
            "Defense",
            "Buff"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/194/19400.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 19401,
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "The beacon smoke breaks through",
          "desc": "Strengthen the next three normal attacks. Each attack will cause 100/130/160/190/220/250 (+100% physical bonus) points of physical damage. The third attack will knock away enemies within the range for 0.75 seconds. (Enter cooldown when the attack is completed or the strengthening effect ends)",
          "cd": "5",
          "cost": "60",
          "tags": [
            "Enhance",
            "Crowd Control",
            "Knock Up"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/194/19410.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 19402,
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "invincible",
          "desc": "After Su Lie briefly charges up, he rushes in the designated direction, causing 100/130/160/190/220/250 (+40% physical bonus) points of physical damage to the enemy and knocking them back. If the enemy is pushed back to the edge of the terrain, it will cause an additional 50% damage and stun it for 0.75 seconds; if Su Lie collides with the enemy building, it will cause 250 (+100% physical bonus) points of physical damage to the building.",
          "cd": "10/9.6/9.2/8.8/8.4/8",
          "cost": "80",
          "tags": [
            "Movement",
            "Knock Back",
            "Stun"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/194/19420.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 19403,
          "type": "Skill 3",
          "name": "A mighty army",
          "desc": "Su Lie lifts the pillar and starts to charge up. When released, he will slam the pillar to the ground, causing 300/375/450 (+150% physical bonus) ~ 1000 (+150% physical bonus) points of physical damage to the enemy and knocking it away for 1 second. When the enemy is knocked back, there will be another shock centered on the enemy when it lands, causing an additional 80% physical damage to other nearby enemies, and the damage of non-heroic units is halved. Passive: Su Lie resonates with the earth. When releasing skills or using enhanced attacks, he will cause 38/42/46 (+25% physical bonus) magic damage to nearby enemy targets for 3 seconds. When charging, you will gain a gradually increasing acceleration effect, up to a maximum of 20%. The charging time affects the damage and range of the skill. Canceling the charge will refund 70% of the skill cooldown.",
          "cd": "45/40/35",
          "cost": "120",
          "tags": [
            "Crowd Control",
            "Knock Up",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/194/19430.png"
        },
        {
